      "content": "The \"perfect\" role was a performance, and now it's time to let the mask drop and see the real you. That disappointment you see in the mirror is just a reflection of your own harsh judgment, not an objective truth. Instead of trying to replace what's gone, consider what you want to *become* next, something that feels authentic to the person you are now.",
